# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent, and is the model side of issue #4441 F4. A
# SET capture accepts an attempt whose member lease was lost: its release
# result and renewal are ignored. With the gate gone the single-tree saga s
# on T1 decides and broadcasts between two shards' captures, so the set holds
# s torn inside one member. A single-tree capture is unaffected, so this
# mutation fires only through the set path (#4441 F3: the property is no
# longer blind for set captures).
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentSetIgnoresLeaseLoss
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a set capture accepts an attempt whose member lease lapsed
PERTURBS: Validate

--- FIND
    /\ IF /\ \A T \in Members : held[T]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the set ignores its members' lease validation.
    /\ IF /\ kind = "set" \/ \A T \in Members : held[T]
--- END
